{"1": "<html><body><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"d-flex flex-column justify-content-lg-between w-100p\"> <div> <div class=\"fs-h3 fs-lg-h3 color-primary-blue\"> 兩廳院2026秋天藝術節 票券95折優惠</div> <div class=\"fs-h5 mt-12 color-light-blue kgibStatic011__item-title\"> <ul> <li>購票活動期間：115/8/8~115/11/29 </li> <li>購買票券享95折優惠 </li>\n</ul></div> </div> <div class=\"mt-12 mt-lg-0\">\n<a href=\"/zh-tw/personal/promotion/card-campaign/opentix_aiaf\" class=\"btn-text btn--arrowRight\"> <span class=\"fs-h6\">了解更多</span><i></i>\n</a> </div> </div></div><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"d-flex flex-column justify-content-lg-between w-100p\"> <div> <div class=\"fs-h3 fs-lg-h3 color-primary-blue\"> 指定影音/外送/搭用車/遊戲平台滿額最高賺300元刷卡金</div> <div class=\"fs-h5 mt-12 color-light-blue kgibStatic011__item-title\"> <ul> <li>活動期間：115/10/1~115/12/31\n</li><li>Netflix、Disney+、Spotify、Uber Eats、Uber、Garena、Apple相關服務等指定平台綁凱基卡最高回饋300元！\n</li><li>需登錄\n</li>\n</ul></div> </div> <div class=\"mt-12 mt-lg-0\">\n<a href=\"/zh-tw/personal/promotion/card-campaign/bindpayment-a\" class=\"btn-text btn--arrowRight\"> <span class=\"fs-h6\">了解更多</span><i></i>\n</a> </div> </div></div><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"d-flex flex-column justify-content-lg-between w-100p\"> <div> <div class=\"fs-h3 fs-lg-h3 color-primary-blue\"> 指定旅行社 / 訂房網 / 航空公司 最高4,500元刷卡金</div> <div class=\"fs-h5 mt-12 color-light-blue kgibStatic011__item-title\"> <ul> <li>活動期間：115/10/1~115/12/31 </li> <li>完成消費任務最高<span style=\"color: #ff623e;\">4,500元</span>刷卡金 </li> <li>分期0利率旅行社：易遊網、雄獅、東南、可樂、鳳凰、百威…等 </li> <li>需登錄</li>\n</ul></div> </div> <div class=\"mt-12 mt-lg-0\">\n<a href=\"/zh-tw/personal/promotion/card-campaign/travelagency-b\" class=\"btn-text btn--arrowRight\"> <span class=\"fs-h6\">了解更多</span><i></i>\n</a> </div> </div></div><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"d-flex flex-column justify-content-lg-between w-100p\"> <div> <div class=\"fs-h3 fs-lg-h3 color-primary-blue\"> 海外實體消費 最高5%回饋</div> <div class=\"fs-h5 mt-12 color-light-blue kgibStatic01